OL,3,GNEWSATwo dogs attack woman delivering
OL,4,Aparcel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman delivering a parcel has been
OL,7,Fleft with significant arm injuries
OL,8,Fafter being attacked by two dogs.
OL,10,FThe woman, in her 30s, was at a
OL,11,Fproperty in Malswick, near Newent,
OL,12,Fshortly before 15:00 BST on Saturday
OL,13,Fwhen she was attacked by the two cane
OL,14,Fcorsos.
OL,16,FAlong with her arm injuries, she was
OL,17,Fleft with bite wounds to her body and
OL,18,Fwas taken to Southmead Hospital, where
OL,19,Fshe is awaiting further surgery and
OL,20,Ftreatment.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
