OL,3,GNEWSATwo dogs attack woman delivering
OL,4,Aparcel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe dogs were seized at the scene and a
OL,7,Fman arrested on suspicion of having
OL,8,Fdogs dangerously out of control. He was
OL,9,Freleased on police bail while an
OL,10,Finvestigation continued,
OL,11,FGloucestershire Constabulary said.
